# Walkthrough: AI Institutional Investment Committee Memo Reader Upgrade

We have redesigned and upgraded the **Adversarial Investment Committee Memo Modal** (`#aiAnalystModal`) to eliminate the cramped view and provide a spacious, executive reading experience.

---

## 🎯 Problems Addressed

1. **Cramped Viewport**: The previous modal was restricted to `max-width: 960px` with fixed vertical padding, making extensive memos difficult to read and scroll.
2. **Vertical Real Estate Hogging**: The Grounded Metric KPI bar (6 columns), Sequential QoQ Trajectory Ribbon (5 quarters), and Live News Feed were stacked permanently at the top, consuming ~400px of vertical space and leaving only ~250px for reading.
3. **Tiny Typography**: Markdown memos were rendered in tiny `0.76rem` (~12px) text with tight line heights, causing eye fatigue.
4. **Lack of Presentation & Export Controls**: No easy way to expand full screen, adjust text sizing, or copy the committee synthesis to the clipboard for reports.

---

## 🚀 Key Improvements & Features Implemented

### 1. Ultra-Wide Default Desktop Dimensions
- Replaced the default box sizing with `.ai-modal-box`:
  - **Width**: `95vw` (up to `1400px` max-width, compared to the old 960px).
  - **Height**: `92vh` (with custom-styled neon purple/cyan scrollbars).

### 2. Collapsible Telemetry Signals Drawer (`📊 Hide Signals` / `📊 Show Signals`)
- Wrapped the Grounded KPI bar, QoQ Operating Leverage Trajectory Ribbon, and Real-time News Radar in `#aiTelemetryDrawer`.
- Added a 1-click **`📊 Hide Signals`** toolbar button that collapses this entire section, instantly giving **~90% of the modal viewport exclusively to the analysis memo**.

### 3. Fullscreen Reader Mode (`⛶ Fullscreen`)
- Added a 1-click **`⛶ Fullscreen`** button (and global `Escape` key integration) that expands the modal to **`99vw` width and `98vh` height**, creating a distraction-free, full-display investment committee reading experience.

### 4. Elevated Institutional Typography & Dynamic Scaling (`A-` / `A+`)
- Base body text scaled up to **`0.92rem` (14.5px)** with generous **`1.65` line-height**.
- Seat cards (🐂 Seat 1 Bull, 🐻 Seat 2 Bear, 📡 Seat 3 Radar, ⚖️ Seat 4 Payoff Matrix) styled with distinct background tints, crisp borders, and comfortable internal padding.
- Added **`A-` and `A+` font-scaling buttons** directly in the header toolbar, allowing the user to seamlessly toggle between Compact, Standard, and Large reader typography.

### 5. 1-Click Clipboard Export (`📋 Copy Memo`)
- Added a **`📋 Copy Memo`** button that copies the unrendered markdown text of the memo directly to your system clipboard with visual `✓ Copied!` confirmation.

